00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,000
Ha va malê Bavê Gêndî ye.
 
Oh this is the house of Gendi's father.

160
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Ev hewşê wa, em li hewşê wa ne.
 
This is their courtyard, we are in their courtyard.

161
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,000
Ha vaye min tew nas nake.
 
Oh here, he doesn't know me well at all.

162
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:31,000
Ev nav nake, bes ev hewşa Gêndî ye, emê li hewşê ne.
 
This doesn't make a name, but this is Gendi's courtyard, we
are in the courtyard.

163
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,000
Nelmal ne, hema wisa nelmal ne. Çûn banê kenê.
 
They are not home, just like that not home. They went to the
roof maybe.

164
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:37,000
Em qehwe xolce m'gundî vexwin, w'emê herin mal.
 
We will drink coffee with the villagers, and we will go
home.

165
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
Yanî karê me jî heye, hinekî em cuxê.
 
Meaning we have work too, a bit we [unclear].

166
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:46,000
Ev camiya gundî, gundî o ye. Cami li ber e, bes dikan me
têda nedît. Dikan hene tune ne, ez nizanim.
 
This is the village mosque, the village's. The mosque is in
