Ev war cem Diyarbekirê? Tirkiye yanî?
 
Is this place near Diyarbakir? Turkey, you mean?

257
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:18,000
Belê.. Diyarbekir wê çaxê sînor nebû.. ka sînor hebû?
 
Yes... Diyarbakir, at that time there were no borders...
were there borders?

258
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Yanî 350 salî diçe vê gundî?
 
So this village dates back 350 years?

259
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,000
Ser 350 pêncî re ye.
 
It is over 350, [maybe] fifty more.

260
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

261
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Ser 350 pêncî re ye.. em 350 pêncî li vir in.
 
It is over 350, fifty more... we have been here for 350,
fifty years.

262
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
Belê.
 
Yes.

263
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Em hatin... birayê babê kalê min.. hemberî kîrê.. hemberî..
 
We came... my grandfather's father's brother... opposite
the... opposite...

264
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,000
