Navê wî li wî xweş e, Qasim li navê wî, li tarîxê de.
 
His name fits him well, Qasim is his name, in history.

266
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,000
Navê wî Şahîn hatibû?
 
Had his name been Shahin?

267
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Na, esil Qasim bavê Şahîn e.
 
No, originally Qasim is the father of Shahin.

268
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,000
Te digot çawa rûniştin?
 
How did you say they settled?

269
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Paşê Omer li wê wane ye.
 
Then Omer is over there.

270
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:49,000
Evna hatin vê derê.. dijmin bûn.. derî şikand.. û coyê..
'esê bûn.
 
These people came here... they were enemies... broke the
door... and the stream... they were rebels.

271
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Heta wextê.. we 'arî tûrê.. Ebedî şeşî bî, hêştir anîn.
 
Until the time... that heavy fire... Eternal [Abadi] became
six, they brought camels.

272
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,000
Ebedî şişter tinê xencî wan..
 
Eternal six only except them...

273
00:20:56,000 --> 00:21:03,000
Wê ro vê gundê keleha.. deştê kûra heye.
 
That day, this village of the fortress... there is a deep
plain.

274
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,000
Em hatin cem apê.. ez zanim.. ez zanim.
 
We came to the uncle... I know... I know.

275
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,000
Apê te.. derê şer malava..
 
Your uncle... the place of the fight, may his home be
destroyed...

276
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:12,000
Me gotin ser.. ser.. ser.. em rakin derê ca. Ev kin miletê
me ye, ey miletê me ye.
 
We said on... on... on... let's lift the place up. This is
our nation/people, oh this is our nation.

277
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,000
Kî miletê we ye?
 
Who is your nation?

278
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Ey miletê me ye.. bes hinek xayîn firut..
 
Oh, it is our nation... but some traitors sold out...

279
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Ey me ye.. ewê xirabî.. pîşê dixe tefir.. walah naxweş e
têra.
 
It is ours... that badness... putting it forward creates
division... by God, it is unpleasant.

280
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,000
Me dî.. li ser..
 
We saw... on the...

281
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,000
Ser ew xiraboyê.. bopîlî min e.
 
Regarding those ruins... it belongs to my grandfather.

282
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:25,000
Niha axa.. xanî axa.. tapo li ser navê kê ye?
 
Now the land... the house land... whose name is on the title
deed?

283
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:32,000
Pîşê, pîşê hewa jî.. dereng hat.. ew kevir danî.. Huseynê
Simo dereng girtin.. xanî wî da bû dixema tirme bî.
 
Before, before the air too... came late... he placed that
stone... Huseyn son of Simo took it late... the house was
given to him, it was a tragedy.

284
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:35,000
Xera kir.. kir.. ode.
 
He destroyed it... made it... a room.

285
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Ewi virdaye.. paşê girtin Huseynê Simo.. ewî ewî dereng.. me
dît.. hat girtin.
 
He is over here... then Huseyn son of Simo took it... he, he
was late... we saw... it was taken.

286
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Me azirî wî.. belkî ew, hewalî wî maye?
 
We bothered him... maybe he, his friend remains?

287
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,000
Law dayê ştewaye.. her wextekê wextek xwaye.
 
Oh son, that's how things are... every time has its own
time.

288
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,000
Îjî niha wer badidin o?
 
Are they turning it back now?

289
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:48,000
Yekê.. me be.. ew jî.. cîranê me ye.
 
One... don't mention it... he too... is our neighbor.

290
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Îjî niha ew pî min e.. ew holî ew pî min e.
 
Even now, that belongs to me... that space belongs to me.

291
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Yanî qala wê berê.. hew şikatek kirine, şikatê we dikin?
 
You mean regarding that stone... have they made a complaint,
are they suing you?

292
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:56,000
No şikat bûn.. biçûk bûn.. şikat dikin.
 
No, they were complaints... they were small... they are
complaining.

293
00:21:56,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Me sêwirand.. me şikat sêwirand.. yek perde ferehe yanê..
 
We filmed it... we filmed the complaint... one wide screen,
you mean...

294
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,000
Keçê here mamê bike.. wey.
 
Girl, go handle the uncle... oh my.

295
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,000
Wey.. ca merxwe..
 
Oh... well, brave man...

296
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,000
Here sûret bike.. here wî..
 
Go take a picture... go to him...

297
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,000
Wê filîm şebeke pê xistine?
 
Have they put that film on the network/internet?

298
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Ere.. ere..
 
Yes... yes...

299
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
Bas e, noka holîyane.. dê wêr dera dikin, çi dikin.
 
Okay, now it's a space... they will make a door there,
whatever they do.

300
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:10,000
Mezin e wekî.. here pûysalî cê bike.
 
It is big like... go fix the compass/direction.

301
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,000
Seyda..
 
Seyda (Teacher/Respected Title)...

302
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,000
Were, were..
 
Come, come...

303
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,000
Me dît.. pir fere bî walah.
 
We saw it... it was very wide, by God.

304
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:16,000
Waye.. bes ştê mera reşin, merê ditirsin, mer dibê vekeve..
 
That's it... but things are dark for us, people are scared,
people say get out...

305
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:20,000
Xwe vîk bare.. meselê de şikatê radibin.. rûniştin.. ê çû..
